# Beanstalk Wurm // Plant Beans (CR 715): "You may play an additional land this turn." On turn 1 Bot1 plays a Forest, casts Plant Beans
# for {1}{G} from its two Moxen, then plays a Plains as its second land; a third land is refused (exactly one additional land,
# CR 305.2). The Adventure card goes to exile, not the graveyard. On turn 3 the effect has ended (until end of turn): one Plains is
# played and the next refused, and Beanstalk Wurm, a 5/4 with reach, is cast from exile for {4}{G} (the pool empty after).

